<title>USA: Thomas &amp; Betts acquires Reznor Europe.</title>
<headline>Thomas &amp; Betts acquires Reznor Europe.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS, Tenn. 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thomas &amp; Betts Corp said on Monday it completed a purchase for cash of Reznor Europe from Bullough Plc of Britain.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Reznor Europe manufactures heating systems sold throughout Europe.</p>
<p>Thomas &amp; Betts traded unchanged at 42 during early morning trading.  The company produces connectors and components for worldwide electrical and electronic markets and manufactures and markets heating, mechanical and refrigeration products.</p>
</text>
